### List refund policies ("Standard" is the default out of the box)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refund-policies
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

### Create a slab policy: 100% up to 48h before, 50% up to 6h, fees refunded too
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refund-policies
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"name": "Premiere", "type": "SLAB", "refundFees": true,
 "slabs": [{"minHoursBefore": 48, "percent": 100}, {"minHoursBefore": 6, "percent": 50}]}

### Make it the default for shows without their own policy
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refund-policies/{{policyId}}/make-default
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN
